# Component and Module Rules

Frontend: Page composes components; Feature components live under feature directories; Shared components live under `frontend/src/components/`; API calls must be encapsulated; types must be explicit.

Backend: Route stays thin; business logic lives in Service; database access lives in Repository; Celery Task orchestrates only; external API clients live in integrations.
